  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grantley Adams International Airport Pavement Rehabilitation and Expansion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is expected to enhance GAIA Infrastructure, by the rehabilitation of the runway, taxiways and aprons, widening taxiway Bravo and its link from taxiway Alpha and the East Apron expansion.  In addition, the Project includes the construction of a new South Apron and a taxiway link to the runway. Other components of the Project include  retrofitting pavement lighting to LED fixtures,  landside pavement rehabilitation and expansion works; and perimeter fencing, procurement of  Airfield lighting equipment and car park electric vehicle charging equipment, and  Institutional Strengthening activities.</narrative>
  </description>
